  "source": "Swedish Civil Defence and Resilience Agency",
  "note": [
    "The number of people injured in fires attended by the municipal fire and rescue service, where the initiating event was fire/imminent risk of fire in building, economic activity was normal residence and house type was block of flats, detached, semi-detached, terraced or summer house.\r\n\r\nInjury severity, sex and age group as assessed by fire officer.\r\n\r\nSee table B23 for injuries in other residential situations.\r\n\r\nNote that more comprehensive and reliable statistics on fire deaths are available in <i>Fire deaths</i>, table A10 and A20."
